translate chinese day15_communal_bath_88d7e084:

    # "With a simple wave of her hand she indicates you to follow along, leading you to a set of nooks, furnished with some kind of neatly folded cloth."
    "她简单地挥了挥手，示意你跟上，带你来到一组壁龛前，里面放着某种折叠整齐的布料。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2534
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_5b0e1f94:

    # "You must look absolutely clueless, so she motions for you to take off your clothes and withdraws an example from the nook, unfurling it into a towel to show you what she means."
    "你想起来完全不知所措，所以她示意你脱掉衣服，又从壁龛里拿出一条布料展开成毛巾，让你有样学样。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2536
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_129bdc52:

    # "You take a towel and find yourself immediately struck by how soft the material is."
    "你拿了一条毛巾，马上就被这柔软的材质震惊到了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2542
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_a0b406c1:

    # "Once she gives you some privacy you begin to undress. Somewhat wearily so, and wrap the towel around your waist to keep your modesty."
    "当她给你一点隐私以后你就开始脱衣服。有些疲惫地脱下后，你在你的腰间围了一条毛巾来保持体面。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2549
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_ba20b278:

    # "With that done you step out of the nook again and search for the attendant, who begins to usher you into the next room."
    "完成后，你再次走出壁龛，寻找引导你去下一个房间的澡堂侍者。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2561
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_e9731313:

    # "It's similarly delicate, with a stone table, and a basin with a stoppered brass faucet. The woman points at the table."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2566
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_f6fac43d:

    # "When you sit, she takes you by the shoulder, guiding you down to lay flat on your stomach. She speaks, but perhaps only to herself—once again you don't recognize any of it."
    "当你坐下，她扶住你的肩膀，示意你平躺放松。她说着话，或者是自言自语，因为你一个字也听不懂。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2568
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_e0580b4f:

    # "You hear the stopper being removed, and a pleasant burbling that is joined by a patter like heavy rain as the basin overflows."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2570
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_fa06c94d:

    # "The attendant does not say anything further, which you take as a sign that you're doing what is expected of you."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2577
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_bdf9ac10:

    # "Water, cooler than you'd expected but not unpleasantly cold, is suddenly coursing down your back. Moments later, it's followed by the touch of the marten's paw."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2584
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_20dedb13:

    # "Your eyes shoot back open as calling the scrubbing \"vigorous\" would be a significant understatement. You're surprised when you {i}don't{/i} see your pelt flowing away with the water dribbling down your sides that's how firm she is working you."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2586
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_2f084745:

    # "For a moment you genuinely question your sanity at just how so much strength can come in such a small package."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2588
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_0010dd15:

    # "But,{w} it's also impossible to deny that she has a certain talent."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2594
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_2326be95:

    # "You find yourself growing used to the rough treatment, as more water is dumped upon you, alongside something grittier."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2596
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_5bb112e5:

    # "There is a faintly floral scent, too, and when it fails to dissipate you realize it's been worked all the way down to your skin."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2598
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_525b109a:

    # "You mouth a quiet prayer of gratitude to whatever entity may be watching for the fact that she has only one arm. For you fear that—had she still had both—you would never leave this room alive."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2600
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_0c700a38:

    # "The mental image of yourself kneaded into a neat pile of dough flashes through the dancing colors of your closed eyelids, making it difficult to hold in the laugh."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2602
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_76248a8a:

    # "She seems happy enough to help you though, pushing so firmly against your spine that you wince rather than laugh."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2604
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_289caa13:

    # "No mercy is given though."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2606
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_24d3c9da:

    # "When the Marten is done abusing your back, she indicates for you to roll over by tugging at your side until you get the idea."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2610
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_bf60e704:

    # "You heft your body around and lay there, staring up at the ceiling before you're able to relax enough to close your eyes."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2612
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_bbc659d5:

    # "After another few minutes, and a final, thorough rinsing, the attention stops."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2620
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_3885398e:

    # "You open your eyes again to look for her."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2622
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_75ccd6f4:

    # "Your companion is gesturing towards the next room... or what you {i}hope{/i} is a room. Steam roils through the open door, curling thickly along the ceiling as if something was aflame."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2629
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_a556293f:

    # "It turns out to be more of a hallway, although your sense of direction isn't really needed. All you have to do is follow the billowing steam to its source, a more imposing arch at the end of the corridor."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2631
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_f6e837a4:

    # "Your caution at making your way through is allayed by the sight of several people sharing a large pool in a room filled with dense steam."
    "你看见几个人在一个充满厚厚水汽的房间里共同泡在一个大池子里，这缓解了你穿行过程中的谨慎。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2633
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_25205919:

    # "That probably means that you haven't gotten lost.{w} Yet."
    "那可能意味着你走对了。至少现在是。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2635
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_aac66aae:

    # "The heat would feel palpable under any circumstance—the air thick enough to grab hold of and carry away like spun wool. But after the bath you've just received, it's almost shocking."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2641
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_55a5fb2d:

    # "Self consciousness begins to rear its head as you step through the hallways and into the room."
    "当你穿过走廊走进房间时，你开始回过神来。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2643
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_477947fc:

    # "A couple of heads turn as you do, but just as quickly they return to either their conversations or just to soak in the heat."
    "你一进到房间就有几个脑袋转了过来，但是很快又转了回去，继续他们的闲谈或者继续享受着温热的池水。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2645
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_a9c94e37:

    # "Inside, the room is dominated by a large pool: the source of the clouds of steam. It appears to be fed by a constantly running sluice; when the water overflows, it drains to channels cut into smooth marble."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2647
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_1c53b6fe:

    # "A few visitors sit on ornate wooden benches, set back along the wall."
    "还有一些客人坐在华丽的木制长椅上，靠着墙。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2651
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_872b79a9:

    # "You choose to take another bench, sitting down carefully—almost afraid to break the delicately carved seat—and feeling over your pelt, surprises that there is anything left."
    "你选择了另一张长椅，小心翼翼地坐下，害怕弄坏了这雕刻精美的长椅，之后你抚摸自己的毛发，竟然一点脏东西都没有留下。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2653
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    ". . ."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2655
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_4ef71cba:

    # "Do you just... set aside the towel?"
    "你就这样...把毛巾放在一边吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2657
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_4ab70451:

    # "Some of the other visitors aren't wearing it, so it must be alright."
    "有一些客人没有围着毛巾，所以这样可以。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2659
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_8758ed77:

    # "The water does look rather inviting and you can hardly go in with the towel, can you?"
    "这里的池水相当诱人，而且你不能围着毛巾进去，不是吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2661
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_87810ec6:

    # "It takes another minute or so before you manage to collect enough confidence to undo the towel and set it aside."
    "又过了一分钟左右，你终于鼓起鼓起足够的勇气揭开毛巾，并把它放在一边。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2663
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_f9aa69c9:

    # "Nobody appears to mind."
    "似乎没人在意。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2665
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_83c37c29:

    # "You feel the heat rising from the pool and as a result, you cautiously kneel down and test the water with your hand first."
    "你能感受到从水池中升腾的热气，因此，你小心地蹲下用手测试着水温。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2669
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_7e19826a:

    # "And immediately learn how Bandile's stew must feel!"
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2671
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_7a5e9a25:

    # "Can hardly chicken out now... Not with all these people around, who seem to not have the same problem as you."
    "现在可不能退缩啊...别人都没有你这样的问题。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2675
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_99735e73:

    # "In for a penny, in for a pound.{w} You mentally prepare yourself, take a deep breath and slip into the pool and immediately find yourself fighting to keep your composure as you gradually begin to cook."
    "一不做二不休。{w} 你做好心理准备之后就深吸一口气，滑入池中。但是很快你发现自己很难强装镇定，因为你感觉到自己快被煮熟了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2677
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_210eda5c:

    # "Thankfully the water isn't very deep, and it's supposed to be healthy, right?"
    "幸运的是着水并不深，而且也很健康，是吧？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2679
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_8f80bf50:

    # "And once you've found your place to settle down and your body got used to it ceased to be quite to bad."
    "一旦你找到位置坐了下来，并且你的身体习惯了水温之后，就感觉没有那么糟糕了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2681
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_35841ba6:

    # "Or so you try to convince yourself."
    "至少你是这样说服自己的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2699
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_44863b44:

    # "What's Sam up to right now?"
    "现在Sam在做什么呢？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2701
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_71390ec1:

    # "Or Rajeeyah?..."
    "Rajeeyah呢？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2703
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_d1d89d00:

    # "If they're subjected to a similar pool, you'll all return to the ship red as lobsters."
    "如果她们也被带到这么烫的池子里，那你们回到船上时肯定红得像龙虾。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2705
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_6748a87c:

    # "Though, after a minute the initial discomfort gives way to a curious lassitude, as though the steam is drawing more than air from you when you exhale."
    "不过，几分钟后，原本的不适慢慢转为了一种奇特的慵懒感，仿佛你呼出来的蒸汽也带出了其他东西。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2707
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_61f634a5:

    # "Maybe this is something you could grow used to."
    "也许你会逐渐习惯上这样的洗浴。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2709
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_f2d7b3c8:

    # "The heat feels like it seeps inward, reaching deep into your muscles to coax out any tightness you feel."
    "这里的热气仿佛可以渗透进体内，渗透进肌肉，舒缓紧绷的神经。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2711
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_05af723f:

    # "It's a relief you didn't know you needed."
    "你之前都不知道自己竟然如此疲惫。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2713
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_c47fa910:

    # "You thought the work you did at home would have prepared you, but something about your time on the {i}Conway{/i} drained you in different ways."
    "你以为在家乡的劳作能让你有所准备，但是{i}康威{/i}号上的时光总是用全新的方式消耗着你的精力。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2715
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_1b34baed:

    # "You lift your arms pull your whole body into a stretch, basking in that immediate blissful release it brings."
    "你抬起手臂，全身伸了一个大大的懒腰，沉浸在着即刻带来的愉悦和放松中。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2717
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_1b14347d:

    # "A deep breath turns into a yawn, and your head lolls to one side. You let it rest there, lazily observing the room around you."
    "深吸一口气后打了一个大大的哈欠，之后你的头歪向一边。你就这样靠着，慵懒惬意地观察着你身处的房间。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2719
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_5a9f83f4:

    # "Perhaps you'll pick up a local custom or two, something useful to tuck away."
    "或许你可以学到一两个当地的习俗，或者记住一些有用的东西。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2721
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_4b599831:

    # "There's a group of people right front of you who seem to animatedly discuss something."
    "在你正前方有一群人正在激烈地讨论着什么。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2723
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_8cf12cab:

    # "You wish you knew what it was or what was so important to have their voices echo through these halls."
    "你想知道他们到底在聊什么，或者到底是什么重要的事能让这些大厅的人们都听到他们的讨论。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2725
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_2b0d502d:

    # "Or perhaps it is the exact opposite, and the topic of conversation is as banal as a vendor trying to overcharge for some apples...{w} Or whatever these small fruits were you saw being offered everywhere in town."
    "或许恰恰相反，他们的话题可能平淡无奇，就像市场上大妈讨价还价一样..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2727
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_e0be3c5b:

    # "You make a mental note to try them."
    "你在心里面记下来他们。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2729
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_c9ad8e86:

    # "And again, you find yourself wishing—if only you understood their words, you could simply ask."
    "你又希望你可以听懂他们的话，这样你就可以直接问了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2733
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_d1ce2ed1:

    # "Someone leaves the pool and begins to dry himself off and you chide yourself for staring."
    "有些兽离开了水池，开始擦干身体，你责备自己不该盯着看的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2735
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_08fc4aca:

    # "Not that the gentleman needs to be ashamed of anything."
    "倒不是那位先生有什么值得害羞的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2737
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_cf95efe1:

    # "You peek between your own legs."
    "你偷偷瞥了一眼自己的双腿之间。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2739
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_0f9c4087:

    # "The water lapping gently against your sheath and your mind begins to wander..."
    "水轻轻拍打着你的包皮，你的思绪开始游荡。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2741
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_d24a0ce0:

    # "Wander back over to that other pool Samuel and Rajeeyah must be sharing."
    "游荡到Samuel和Rajeeyah一起泡的那个池子。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2743
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_7b75a4e3:

    # "You will her to be here at your side and be the one to share this moment with."
    "你希望她就在你身边，和你共享这一刻。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2745
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_38d7ceef:

    # "Laying here, with her in your arms. Eyes closed as she breathes in the warm steam and you brush a paw over her head."
    "一起躺在这，你将她搂入怀中。她闭着眼，在温暖的水蒸气中缓缓呼吸而你用爪子轻轻地抚摸着她的头。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2750
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_ad0e2b0b:

    # "You close your eyes to indulge a little further in your emerging thoughts."
    "你闭上眼睛，进一步沉浸在你涌现的思绪中。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2752
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_4aec2ede:

    # "You begin to imagine her fur settling on you."
    "你开始现象她的毛发贴在你身上的感觉。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2754
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_760527d8:

    # "Kisses first, tentative perhaps. A peck on her cheek before she demands more of you.{w} You'd oblige. Heartily."
    "首先是试探性的一吻。在她要求更多之前，你先亲吻她的脸颊。{w}你欣然应许。非常乐意。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2756
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_82900d1e:

    # "The contact is deep—and fierce. The two weeks on the ship with so little privacy having you left more needy than usual."
    "接下来一吻又深又激烈。在船上的两周你几乎没有隐私，因此你比以往更加饥渴。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2758
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_87c716d3:

    # "You imagine her smile as boyishly toothy when she leans back, arms still draped over your shoulders, crossing behind your neck. You don't have to ask what the maned wolf {i}wants{/i}."
    "你想象着她向后靠时露出的男孩子般咧嘴的笑，双臂仍然搭在你的双肩上，在后颈处交叉。你不必问着鬃狼想{i}想{/i}要什么。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2760
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_67c81f84:

    # "You slide over and recline on your back. Sam straddles you, leaning down to rub her nose against yours. Then her expression changes, and she frowns."
    "你滑过去，仰面躺下。Sam跨坐在你身上，俯下身用鼻子去蹭你的鼻子。之后她的表情改变了，她开始皱眉。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2762
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_be858144:

    # "You frown, though not in your imagination."
    "你也皱起眉头，不过不是在在幻想中。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2774
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_b32c6523:

    # "Ah, you shouldn't!{w} And most certainly not here..."
    "啊，你不应该！{w}而且绝对不该在这里..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2776
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_8b3c1b02:

    # "A twinkle of guilt sets in immediately and you shake your head, trying to free yourself from it."
    "一丝愧疚感立刻涌上心头，你摇摇头，想摆脱它。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2778
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_9b2deaad:

    # "Thankfully it didn't have any visible effect on you just yet."
    "幸好它还没有对你产生任何明显的影响。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2780
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_af58c674:

    # "Maybe this damn heat is getting to you."
    "也许这些该死的热气让你昏头了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2784
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_403512b2:

    # "You push yourself out of the water, first sitting down on the edge of the pool to make the transition a little smoother before you get out to pick up your towel again."
    "你将自己拉出水，先坐在浴池的边缘便于接下来顺利起身，之后你再去拿上你的毛巾。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2786
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_b9aadc6c:

    # "It's probably a good idea to see if the other two are done as well."
    "或许现在去看看其他两位是否也洗好了是个好主意。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2788
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_f570d641:

    # "Scanning the room you figure that you'll probably leave through the other door on the opposite end."
    "扫视着房间，你推测你可能从对面另一端的门离开。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2790
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_ae19991f:

    # "One of the other men tries to talk to you on your way there but all you can do is just apologize with one of the few words you've learned and make your exit."
    "在路上另一个男人试图和你搭话，但是你唯一能做的只是用你学过的几个单词道歉，好让你脱身。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2794
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_a00bd965:

    # "You're led into another hallway that's branching two ways. You pick one and the door it leads to welcomes you back into the main area."
    "你被引导了一条分岔的走廊，你选了一条路，然后你回到了大厅。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2804
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_f36dc465:

    # "That must have been it?"
    "就是这里吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2806
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_a7e0b870:

    # "You see neither Samuel nor Rajeeyah, and wonder if they'll just come out looking like boiled chicken at this rate."
    "你没有看到Samuel和Rajeeyah，你很想知道她们走出来的时候是不是红得像煮熟的鸡肉。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2808
translate chinese day15_communal_bath_46345764:

    # "You find your clothes and get yourself dressed again, the pleasant draft of this space does a great job of pleasantly cooling your down again."
    "你找到了你的衣服并将它们穿好，这里舒服地微风美美地让你凉爽下来。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2842
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_e5b946f5:

    # p "You don't suppose Perce is back already, do you?"
    p "你觉得Perce回来的吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2844
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_4a8d2e85:

    # "The maned wolf scowls, flicking her left ear, although you can't help but notice how she searches the {i}Conway{/i}'s railings from the dockside, just in case."
    "鬃狼皱起眉头，抖了抖她的左耳，尽管你不禁注意到她是怎么从码头边上扫视着{i}康威{/i}号的栏杆，为了以防万一。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2846
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_79c25bdc:

    # s "Hopin' he's not. Wouldn't be good for me plans an' all if I had to deck the bloody jackal. Just want to get something from below-decks, and ask a question or two."
    s "希望他还没回来。揍那只该死的豺狼对我的计划可不好。我只是想从甲板下面拿一点东西，再吻一两个问题。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2848
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_750e8dc3:

    # "Perce is not back aboard, as it happens; the sailor standing watch lets you up the gangplank, and at a question in Samuel's lowered voice gestures over his shoulder."
    "碰巧，Perce还没有回船。值班的水手让你们走上跳板，在Samuel低声的询问中，他向他的肩膀后方示意了一下。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2859
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_d8aecc33:

    # "Rajeeyah, you see: the ship's surgeon is on the main deck, paws on the railing and face turned towards the sun."
    "你看到了Rajeeyah。船医此时在主甲板上，爪子搭在栏杆上，面朝太阳。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2869
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_ff978d6e:

    # "She opens her eyes at your approach, and smiles warmly."
    "当你走近时，她睁开了眼睛，温暖地笑了笑。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2871
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_2c585842:

    # r "Mr. O'Connor. And-ah, Mr. [family_name], I see. Can I help you two?"
    r "O'Connor先生。啊，还有[family_name]先生，我明白了。有什么需要帮助的？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2875
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_dfd438a3:

    # s "Me, yes, you can. Not him."
    s "是的，我需要你的帮助，但是不是他。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2877
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_f429ce9f:

    # s "I've a question. An' you, though, [name]..."
    s "我有个问题。不过你呢，[name]..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2881
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_8a9cd7be:

    # "She turns to you, pointing in the direction of the ship's berths."
    "她转向你，指向船上居住舱的方向。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2883
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_c340c888:

    # s "In me chest, there's a bag—a coin purse. You'll know, 'cause it jingles like a coin purse. And I know how many of them be in it, so..."
    s "在我的箱子里，有一个袋子，准确来说是一个钱袋。你认得出来，一摇就知道。并且，我知道里面有多少钱，所以..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2885
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_2762664e:

    # p "I won't borrow too many."
    p "我不会借太多的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2889
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_91eacbdb:

    # "Sam grins at you, and you make your retreat."
    "Sam对你咧嘴一笑，你便退开了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2902
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_e161d9d7:

    # "You do wonder what the two are discussing."
    "你真的很像知道她们在聊些什么。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2906
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_88cba52b:

    # "She must, you figure, be planning on asking Rajeeyah about the city's bathhouses."
    "你猜，她一定是打算问问Rajeeyah关于这城市中澡堂的事。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2908
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_b3fba097:

    # "It's a private conversation, after all. Perhaps venting frustrations about Perce."
    "毕竟这是私人谈话。也许是在发泄对Perce的不满。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2915
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_32c9a970:

    # "There are no sailors in the berths; anyone not working a shift, you suppose, is taking advantage of the time in port to sleep topside."
    "在居住舱里面没有水手；你猜，所有不当班的人都在利用靠港的时间在上面的甲板上休息。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2919
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_e5ddb8e0:

    # "You find Sam's chest without too much difficulty. Inside are her clothes, some utensils, a deck of cards you spot, and a collection of small... jewelry?"
    "你轻易地找到了Sam的箱子。里面是她的衣服，一些个人用品，你还发现了一叠纸牌，还有一堆...小首饰？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2921
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_0fba9d7a:

    # "Totems, perhaps. A carved shell. A brass animal of some kind."
    "也许是图腾。一个被雕刻过的贝壳。和一个某种动物的黄铜雕塑。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2923
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_28eef4f4:

    # "For a moment you think about having a closer look, but rummaging around feels too invasive. Something to ask her about, instead, when you get the chance."
    "有一瞬间你想凑近点好好看看，但是随意翻别人的东西感觉太冒犯了。你还是有机会的时候问问她吧。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2935
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_7085484c:

    # "You retrieve the coin purse and return topside."
    "你取出钱袋，返回甲板。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2937
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_400add30:

    # "Sam and Rajeeyah are nowhere to be seen, although when you make your way to the infirmary you hear their voices."
    "你到处找不到Sam和Rajeeyah，然而当你走向医务室时，你听见了她们两个的声音。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2947
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_27fc134e:

    # "So, no great mystery about where they've gone to—probably desiring even more privacy."
    "所以，她们来这里并没有什么奇怪的，也许是想要更多的隐私。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2951
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_8b3e3484:

    # r "Are you really sure about this?"
    r "你确定真的要这样吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2953
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_143820d7:

    # s "Sure about what?"
    s "确定什么？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2955
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_68be7f6b:

    # r "Well... him."
    r "嗯...他的事。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2957
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_d7992274:

    # r "I told you about what he did."
    r "我告诉过你他做了什么。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2959
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_ff4dfd05:

    # "There's a brief pause in their conversation before Rajeeyah speaks up again."
    "短暂的沉默之后，Rajeeyah再次开口。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2961
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_93096b23:

    # r "Well, I can hardly dictate what you can or cannot do. I just want to make sure that my reservations have been heard."
    r "好吧，我不能强迫你做什么或者不做什么。我只是想确定我的顾虑被听见了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2963
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_7d7f2f20:

    # r "Anyway..."
    r "总之..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2967
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_9b7411eb:

    # r "And... well."
    r "还有...好吧。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2969
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_4da92668:

    # r "I haven't seen what you have, I suppose."
    r "我想，我并不了解事件的全貌。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2971
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_76e7e8ca:

    # r "Anyway."
    r "总之。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2973
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_7246fd0d:

    # r "{alpha=0.5}I think they'll understand.{/alpha}"
    r "{alpha=0.5}我想他们会理解的。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2975
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_415f7a6c:

    # s "{alpha=0.5}Hope so.{/alpha}"
    s "{alpha=0.5}希望如此。{/alpha}"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2977
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_d0f9f0ba:

    # "Having caught your head peeking through the door, Raj gestures in your direction."
    "Raj发现了你在门旁边鬼鬼祟祟地偷听，便朝你的方向示意。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2995
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_1bd85ecf:

    # r "Or just ask him. He can interpret."
    r "或者直接问他。他会理解的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:2997
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_fdcde99f:

    # p "Me? You hardly taught me anything."
    p "我吗？你几乎没教我任何东西。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3001
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_2a2355a5:

    # r "Or just point at him. He looks nonthreatening."
    r "或者直接指向他。他看起来没有威胁性。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3005
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_98d2f54e:

    # s "So if we turn up kidnapped..."
    s "那么，如果我们被绑了..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3007
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_649b9c5c:

    # r "I'll tell Arthur who to blame, yes."
    r "我会告诉Arthur该怪谁的，没错。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3011
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_fd6544d9:

    # s "Thanks, doctor."
    s "谢谢，医生。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3015
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_d0cb0de8:

    # "Sam indicates that you should follow her, and explains once you're out in the open air again."
    "Sam示意你跟着她，走到外边时，她解释道。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3028
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_dbf89b40:

    # s "You got me money?"
    s "你拿到我的钱了吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3030
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_de91c49d:

    # "You hold up the purse, and she takes it, judging the weight in her paw—though, from the glint in her eyes, she's not seriously accusing you."
    "你举起钱袋，她接过去摇了摇，又在爪中掂量掂量它的重量，眼睛一闪，看来数量没错了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3034
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_8d47e4a2:

    # p "This might be out of the blue, but I have been wondering about it since he said it."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3036
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_ad6d13b0:

    # p "When I talked with Arthur he mentioned that some of the crew helped convince him to let me stay."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3038
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_053e9be3:

    # s "Mhm, that's nice of them."
    s ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3040
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_1ff26e6b:

    # p "That was you, wasn't it?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3042
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_9c95ae76:

    # "Her expression softens."
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3044
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_70d4d1f7:

    # s "What if it was?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3046
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_b32503cf:

    # p "Dumb question. Then I'd have to thank you for standing up for me."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3048
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_4ec90259:

    # p "You didn't have to do that. Especially not risking it against someone of a higher rank."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3050
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_a278df2c:

    # p "But you did."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3052
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_76b8ae1b:

    # p "And didn't say a word."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3056
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_1baea9ac:

    # s "I wanted to avoid {i}this.{/i} For you to view me as some kind of savior or something. Or even worse: trying to make up for it."
    s ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3060
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_6f3d15ca:

    # s "It just wasn't right to see you go over that. I saw you putting just as much effort into your work as the next guy, like."
    s ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3062
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_11b2dbf1:

    # s "An' Arthur told me at some point that I should never be afraid to speak my mind with him in private."
    s ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3064
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_77cd872d:

    # s "So I did.{w} But I don't think it was my doing that you got to stay, I'm sure he just needed a nudge to right his thoughts."
    s ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3066
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_dd5bdf78:

    # p "Thank you."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3068
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_bd8810a6:

    # s "Don't mention it."
    s ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3070
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_c96607a6:

    # s "Still don't feel like bein' on the ship. So, unless you've got strong feelings otherwise, you're enlisted on an errand."
    s "我看你还是不想待在船上。所以，除非你强烈反对，要不然你就要被征召去跑个差事。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3072
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_d86e0ec8:

    # p "With you?"
    p "和你一起？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3076
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_ed8e19d1:

    # s "Strong feelings against?"
    s "强烈反对？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3078
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_81c82914:

    # p "No!{w} Of course not, I'd love to!"
    p "不！{w}当然没有，我很乐意。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3080
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_7429a8a1:

    # p "An errand for Rajeeyah?"
    p "Rajeeyah的差事？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3092
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_ca3b9ba1:

    # "She nods. Off the ship again, she looks around, her eyes sweeping the buildings visible along the harbor-front."
    "她点点头。再次离开船后，她环顾四周，扫过那些沿着港口铺开的房屋。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3094
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_0cd0579f:

    # s "There, I guess it must be. Findin' a {i}souk{/i}, they call it, now."
    s "我猜就在那了。找到那个本地人叫{i}souk{/i}的地方。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3096
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_d72aa207:

    # p "What is that? An herb, or something?"
    p "那是什么？草药，还是其他的什么。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3098
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_5459cb9d:

    # s "No. Supposed to be a great market."
    s "不。据说是一个大市场。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3102
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_ebf4f429:

    # s "Rajeeyah said, we get a couple blocks away an' we can find it by smell. That should be interesting."
    s "Rajeeyah说，我们走过几个街区后，凭着气味就可以找到它。那应该挺有意思的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3104
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_90319b69:

    # p "Good smell or bad smell?"
    p "是很好闻的味道吗？还是很难闻？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3108
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_90b1580d:

    # s "Well, I don't suppose they're selling used chamberpots, do you?"
    s "呃，我想他们总不会再卖用过的夜壶吧，你觉得呢？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3112
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_9b34fdb3:

    # s "Eh—watch out!"
    s "呃，小心！"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3116
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_ad953af9:

    # "She ducks behind you, giving you a shove to push you aside and make room for a passing wagon."
    "她闪到你身后，把你猛猛推开，给疾驰而过的马车让路。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3120
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_248c07a3:

    # "This, her snicker suggests, was more for the opportunity to do so than concern for your safety."
    "从她的窃笑来看，这么用力推你不是关心你的安全，而是恰好有这个机会。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3136
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_79b3a209:

    # s "Are you sure that you didn't want to go gambling with Julian?"
    s "你确定你不想和Julian一起去赌博吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3138
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_cde92cc7:

    # p "No."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3140
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_31db4c95:

    # s "Since I know you two do it occasionally."
    s "毕竟我知道你们两个偶尔会去玩这个。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3142
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_f40b983c:

    # p "We have enough time for dice on the ship. I don't need to spend my time out here with it as well."
    p "我们在船上有足够的时间投色子。我可不想在外面浪费时间做这个。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3144
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_3c7a9299:

    # p "This market beats it by a mile. As does spending some time with you."
    p "这个市场可比赌博好强多了。和你待一起也是。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3148
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_8a97c79c:

    # s "What are you betting anyway? Not like you've got much of a wage to put on the line yet."
    s "你平时都赌什么？你好像没有多少薪水可以拿来押注吧。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3150
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_875ce35a:

    # p ". . ."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3152
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_fff163da:

    # p "You can play just for the fun of it."
    p "我们存粹是为了好玩。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3156
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_f6ce71c2:

    # s "Why did that take you so long to answer?"
    s "你为啥沉默了这么久才回答。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3158
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_4c437084:

    # p "I was distracted."
    p "我分心了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3160
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_36567dc2:

    # s "Sure you were."
    s "是吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3162
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_e8fe8700:

    # "You're headed deeper into the city's heart, and it doesn't take long to discover that Raj had been right."
    "你们朝着城市深处走去，没过多久就闻到了Raj所说的“味道”。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3164
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_ffda04aa:

    # "The aroma of spices, and cooked meat, was both immediately recognizable... and immediately exotic. Sam lifts her muzzle, sniffing pointedly."
    "空气中弥漫着香料和肉类的香气，充满着异域风情。Sam抬起了她的口鼻，特意地嗅了嗅。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3166
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_59c30cc4:

    # "The {i}souk{/i} throngs with activity and—like the dock—a curious mix of species and uniforms."
    "{i}souk{/i}里熙熙攘攘，热闹非凡，就像港口一样，身着不同服装，不同种族的兽人在此交融，引人好奇。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3173
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_d73db186:

    # "You hear your own language, amidst a half-dozen others; turning curiously to look, you can't find the speaker."
    "你听到了家乡的语言，就在那熙熙攘攘的人群中；好奇地转过身，但是找不到说话的人。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3178
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_de849386:

    # "Turning back, you can't find Sam, either."
    "当你转过身来时，你也找不到Sam了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3183
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_1eb2124a:

    # "All around you are stalls filled with fruit, and candied dates, and carved wooden utensils. A seller has books, their titles inlaid with gold."
    "你周围都摆满了水果，蜜枣还有雕刻过的木制器具。有个商人再卖书，书名镶着金边。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3185
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_1f7c47ef:

    # "You wonder what they're about. Something of incomparable value, you assume."
    "你好奇这些书是关于什么的。你猜，有些书可能是无价之宝吧。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3187
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_880c5a11:

    # "One of the books is open, though, and you see columns of neat Arabic, facing columns of neat printed characters you {i}can{/i} read:"
    "不过，其中一本书是翻开的，你看到一栏整齐的阿拉伯文，下面是一行行你{i}确实{/i}能读懂的印刷得整整齐齐的文字："

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3189
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_93d230a1:

    # "{i}\"He is a banker in Filadelfiya, of State Bensalveniya.\"{/i}"
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3191
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_600eac7d:

    # "{i}\"How far is the caravan to Filadelfiya?\"{/i}"
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3193
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_f66879de:

    # "{i}\"The journey is two days.\"{/i}"
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3195
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_870c7854:

    # "{i}\"Does the caravan go to Anebolis?\"{/i}"
    ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3197
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_f871baeb:

    # "It's a guidebook, you realize: a simple commodity, but leatherbound and illuminated as if a fabled alchemical text."
    "你意识到这是一本指南。虽然是一件简单的商品，但是皮革装订，闪闪发光，仿佛传说中的炼金术典籍。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3199
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_81a7d44a:

    # "{i}Everything{/i} around you, now that you take it in, seems precise, polished, and wealthy."
    "现在你仔细一看，你身边的{i}一切{/i}似乎都那么精致，光洁，富丽堂皇。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3201
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_e88cb74e:

    # "The seller, having noticed your interest, is shouting at you."
    "摊主注意到了你的兴趣，朝着你喊。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3208
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_4eafd7e1:

    # p "{i}Shukran{/i}!"
    p "{i}Shukran{/i}!"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3210
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_038bd88b:

    # "You shake your head. Raj has taught you that this means 'thank you,' if you remember correctly, and it's the closest you can come to politely declining."
    "你摇摇头，如果你没记错的话，Raj教过你这是“谢谢”的意思，并且这是你所能想到的最礼貌的拒绝方式了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3214
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_f7663b84:

    # "You shake your head, and when he continues talking, you shake it more vigorously."
    "你摇摇头，然而他仍继续滔滔不绝地说着，你摇得更用力了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3221
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_39c076e8:

    # "Fortunately, you're saved from further explanation by the sight of Sam's ears, poking out over the crowd."
    "幸好，你在人群中看到了Sam的耳朵，让你免于进一步解释。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3223
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_f4621741:

    # "You push your way through it to find her, although the maned wolf—it seems—hadn't even noticed your absence. She grins at you, though."
    "你在人群中穿梭去找她，虽然鬃狼似乎没有注意到你丢了。但她还是对你咧嘴笑了笑。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3227
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_3a1cf88f:

    # s "There's so much here!"
    s "这里的东西可真多！"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3229
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_364e1586:

    # p "You know what you're looking for?"
    p "你知道你在找什么吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3231
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_e8b34e51:

    # s "Everything! Just enjoy it."
    s "什么都看看！好好享受吧。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3237
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_51fd7b01:

    # "You try, even when something catches her attention and she slips gracefully through the throng of fellow shoppers to vanish again."
    "你想好好享受，但是Sam看上了什么东西，优雅地滑入购物的人群中，再次没影了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3239
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_44c4695e:

    # "You lose her twice more before you finally regroup—significantly later—at the {i}souk{/i}'s entrance."
    "你又跟丢她两次，过了好一会儿后，你们终于在{i}souk{/i}的入口重新会和了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3255
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_9be9410c:

    # "Her tail is wagging excitedly."
    "她的尾巴兴奋地摇晃着。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3257
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_4360c2e9:

    # s "Quite an experience!"
    s "说实话挺好玩的！"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3259
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_c9cd79db:

    # p "Quite. You have whatever Rajeeyah wanted you to get?"
    p "确实。对了，你拿到Rajeeyah叫你买的东西了吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3263
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_fbaadd89:

    # s "I did that, aye."
    s "买好了，嗯。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3265
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_101c6241:

    # "She lifts up a small bundle for your inspection."
    "你举起一个小包给你看看。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3269
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_8b0a3260:

    # s "Don't be askin' me what it is, though. Little bottles of things, that's all."
    s "不过别问我里面都是些什么。就只是一些瓶瓶罐罐。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3271
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_7806f211:

    # s "Not s'pposed to drink any of them."
    s "可别想着喝它们。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3273
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_d175d85f:

    # p "She said that?"
    p "她是这么说的吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3277
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_ef2d4a2f:

    # s "No,{w} I did. I can see you're thinking about it."
    s "不，{w}我说的。我知道你脑子里面在想什么。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3279
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_b9f39000:

    # "You weren't, but still shift your expression to appear more... professional, perhaps."
    "你并没有想喝，但是你仍然转变了你的表情，让你显得更....专业？可能吧。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3281
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_12456a21:

    # p "I'll try to keep myself under control."
    p "我会尽力控制自己。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3285
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_50d8643b:

    # p "No guarantees, though. You might have to fight me for it eventually."
    p "但是不能保证。说不定到时候你还会和我抢呢。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3287
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_f06fe552:

    # s "Easy win."
    s "那我一定赢。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3289
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_7825ea49:

    # p "You wish."
    p "你想得美。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3291
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_682acd4f:

    # s "Bet on it?"
    s "敢赌吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3293
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_3f53c747:

    # "You hesitate and study her for a few moments."
    "你犹豫了一下，打量了她片刻。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3295
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_df6d04af:

    # p "N-... well, no. {w}I don't have any money on me."
    p "不....呃，不了。{w}我没有带钱。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3297
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_25e8de8e:

    # s "Oh. {i}of course.{/i}"
    s "哦{i}当然。{/i}"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3299
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_87a8f35d:

    # "You thought it was a good excuse..."
    "你以为这是一个好借口..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3303
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_d8f80067:

    # "You've gone far enough into the city that you can no longer see the masts of ships in the harbor, and the day has begun to palpably cool."
    "深入城市之中，你已经看不到港口里船的桅杆了，而且天气也明显转凉。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3305
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_ff41c221:

    # p "Should we be heading back?"
    p "我们该回去了吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3307
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_db8e0325:

    # s "Maybe. You want to?"
    s "也许吧。你想回去吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3309
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_fea00cb5:

    # p "Well... there must be things to do. Work, right? Arthur..."
    p "嗯...船上一定有更重要的事去做。工作，是吧？Arthur..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3313
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_3a38f06c:

    # "Sam gives you a pointed look that almost verges on a glare."
    "Sam意味深长地看了你一眼，那目光几乎是怒视。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3315
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_adfa9fa6:

    # s "You think I'm much for doin' him favors now, eh? We're not on watch 'til tomorrow, anyhow. 'Cause of the errand."
    s "你觉得我很想回去为他工作，嗯？反正明天才轮到我们值班。因为跑差事。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3319
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_120a54f6:

    # s "Got somewhere else to go, still. I don't suppose..."
    s "我们还有别的地方要去。我猜..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3323
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_fda4de7c:

    # "She holds up a slip of paper, taken from Rajeeyah's notebook and with the cheetah's precise lettering covering it."
    "她举起一张纸条，是从Rajeeyah的笔记本上撕下来的，上面写满了猎豹工整的字迹。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3325
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_5f520b5c:

    # "One side holds what, you imagine, is an impromptu shopping list. You can make out the words for {i}niter{/i} and {i}-of mercury{/i}."
    "一面你猜是临时的购物清单。你能辨认出{i}硝石{/i}和{i}汞{/i}这几个词。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3329
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_964dc38c:

    # "But then Sam flips it over, and you can make out nothing at all. It's all written in Arabic."
    "但是接着Sam翻过那张纸后，你竟然一点都看不懂。上面都是阿拉伯文字。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3333
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_intro_343ba29b:

    # p "Uh. No."
    p "呃...看不懂。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3371
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_9bd84c7a:

    # s "Another helpful local, then. He looks friendly, right?"
    s "那么就再找一个乐于助人的本地人吧。你看他看起来挺面善的不是吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3380
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_df35e6e8:

    # "She indicates a lion leaning against the wall, seemingly observing the {i}souk{/i} with faint interest."
    "她指了指靠着墙的那位狮子兽人。他似乎带着些许兴趣看着{i}souk{/i}。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3382
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_5a01337f:

    # "Perhaps he, too, has a friend lost in the sights and smells of the bazaar."
    "或许他也有朋友迷失在了这里的灯火和香气之中了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3387
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_3824ba62:

    # p "I suppose so..."
    p "我想是吧..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3389
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_1ef3a65e:

    # "He doesn't shy away from your approach, at least, or frown when Sam holds the note up."
    "至少，当你靠近时他并没有回避，Sam向他举起纸条的时候也没有皱眉。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3393
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_2fa256fa:

    # "Taking the piece of paper from her, the lion scans it, tucks his tongue into his muzzle, and then nods."
    "狮子兽人从她的手中接过纸条，扫视着它，再将手头卷回口中，点了点头。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3395
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_48306a7a:

    # reggie "{i}Al-nazla? Na'am, min al-sa'al wasulah.{/i}"
    reggie "{i}阿尔-纳兹拉？嗯，从阿尔-萨阿尔瓦苏拉。{/i}"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3402
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_ebfb8814:

    # "Sam glances at you hopefully."
    "Sam满怀希望地看了你一眼。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3406
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_9d1d8ba3:

    # "You decide you might as well try your best."
    "你也决定尽自己最大努力。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3408
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_cea77b0b:

    # "Can't have what little Rajeeyah taught you go to waste."
    "可不能白费了Rajeeyah教给你的那一点点东西。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3410
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_bd1bbf58:

    # "If you can even manage to remember half of it."
    "即使你连一半都未必记得住。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3417
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_c02af1ce:

    # p "{i}Min fadlak. Arabi bitakalam kuwa...{/i} uh... uh. {i}Kuwayes...{/i}"
    p "{i}Min fadlak. Arabi bitakalam kuwa...{/i} uh... uh. {i}Kuwayes...{/i}(阿拉伯语，大意：“你不会说阿拉伯语”)"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3419
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_576f8cbf:

    # "You hope this means something like: {i}”please, we don't speak Arabic.”{/i}"
    "你希望这些意思类似：{i}“拜托，我们不说阿拉伯语。”{/i}"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3421
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_69828720:

    # "Judging from the lion's smile, it does not."
    "但是从狮子兽人的笑容不难看出，并不是这样。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3425
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_5ec47178:

    # "Though you fail to see where that hope is coming from."
    "虽然你们不明白希望从何而来。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3427
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_fce7b6d9:

    # "You don't think you know a single word..."
    "你觉得自己连一个字都不认识。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3429
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_0adaa033:

    # "But you've managed to deal with worse situations at this point."
    "来都来了，况且你们也处理过更糟的情况。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3436
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_e12eb3d6:

    # p "Er... No Arab.{w} Sorry."
    p "呃....不会阿拉伯语。{w}抱歉。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3438
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_23cac935:

    # "Judging from the lion's smile, you think he may just about understand."
    "狮子兽人笑了笑，你认为他大概听懂了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3440
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_c56ddd69:

    # reggie "{i}Mash. Ant' la tatakalam alarabiyyat.{/i}"
    reggie "{i}Mash. Ant' la tatakalam alarabiyyat.{/i}（阿拉伯语，大意：“行了，你别说阿拉伯语了。”）"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3442
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_79863af4:

    # "But his grin widens, at least."
    "不过，至少他笑容咧得更开了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3444
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_0178279c:

    # reggie "Good. You... go to it? You want?"
    reggie "很好。你...要去那吗？想去吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3451
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_924c7666:

    # "The maned wolf nods quickly."
    "鬃狼迅速地点了点头。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3455
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_d87471cb:

    # s "Yes—to go there!{w} How do we go there—that's exactly right, thank you."
    s "对，去那里！{w}我们怎么去那里，说得没错，谢谢。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3462
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_763355bf:

    # "He frowns thoughtfully, then gestures with a casual wave of the hand."
    "他若有所思地皱着眉，之后随意地挥了挥手。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3464
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_213df0ef:

    # reggie "Mm. Go. {i}Pour aller, euh... la... ce rue.{/i}"
    reggie "嗯。走。{i}Pour aller, euh... la... ce rue.{/i}（法语：要去，呃……那条……这条街。）"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3466
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_fd9c738f:

    # "You and Sam follow the direction he's pointing."
    "你和Sam沿着他指的方向走去。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3473
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_10377c81:

    # s "This street?"
    s "这条街？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3475
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_fc4c7d61:

    # "The maned wolf guesses first, and the Moroccan man nods."
    "鬃狼率先猜了出来，而狮子兽人点了点头。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3482
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_cc36c547:

    # reggie "Street. {i}Ce{/i} street... {i}amshi, jusqu'a... batiment bleu. Bleu{/i}."
    reggie "街。{i}Ce{/i}（法语：这）街……{i}amshi, jusqu'a... batiment bleu. Bleu{/i}（阿拉伯语/法语混合：走，直到……蓝色建筑。蓝色）。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3484
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_bc346d8e:

    # "He repeats it, and tilting his head upwards, at the azure sky. Now it's your turn to guess:"
    "他重复了一遍，并抬起头看着蔚蓝的天空。现在轮到你猜了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3487
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_7ccec57a:

    # p "Blue?"
    p "蓝色？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3491
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_61d419a2:

    # p "Bleu?..."
    p "Bleu？（法语：蓝色？）"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3493
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_508623ae:

    # p "Bleu, bleu, bleu..."
    p "Bleu, bleu, bleu...（法语：蓝，蓝，蓝……）"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3495
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_769e9e51:

    # s "Blue?"
    s ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3497
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_1a37738a:

    # reggie "Blue! {i}Batiment{/i} blue, and you... you turn {i}gauche{/i}, so..."
    reggie "蓝色! {i}Batiment{/i}（法语：建筑） 蓝色, 然后你...向 {i}gauche{/i}（法语：左）转, 所以..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3499
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_2525cc66:

    # "He had been pantomiming the act of walking with his fingers, which is easy enough to follow."
    "他一直用手指比划行进的动作，很容易理解。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3501
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_eed04d61:

    # "Then he taps the note with a worn claw, where Rajeeyah had underlined some of the script."
    "之后他用粗糙的爪子在Rajeeyah画线的几句文字上敲了敲。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3503
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_e1dd21c8:

    # reggie "{i}Nom{/i}. Name. {i}Cela{/i}. Name."
    reggie "{i}Nom{/i}（法语：名字）。名字。{i}Cela{/i}（法语：那个）。名字。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3507
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_3e8b7b99:

    # p "We walk to a blue place and turn left? And find the name there."
    p "我们走到一个蓝色的地方之后左转？然后我们就找到这名字了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3509
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_206700d3:

    # p "Uh. {i}Shukran{/i}."
    p "呃。{i}Shukran{/i}（阿拉伯语：谢谢）。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3511
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_33ffdf70:

    # "That fetches another grin from the lion, who hands the note back to Sam and then pats you, his fellow feline, on the shoulder, repeating his earlier praise:"
    "着又惹得狮子笑了起来，他把纸条交还给Sam并且拍了拍同为猫科动物的你的肩膀，重复了他先前的赞扬。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3513
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_1b98887d:

    # reggie "Good."
    reggie "不错"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3522
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_83e0bc86:

    # "As you start off again, you can only hope you earned it."
    "当你再次出发时，你希望你配得上这份赞扬。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3526
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_8bee5d54:

    # p "Do you have any idea, Sam?"
    p "你有什么头绪吗，Sam？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3528
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_8fbb37e5:

    # s "Hm... walk to the blue place and then turn..."
    s "呃...走到一个蓝色的地方，之后转..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3530
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_aff21e2a:

    # "Sam points from left to right, studying him for any reaction."
    "Sam从左指到右，观察着他的反应。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3532
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_886c2c9e:

    # "He taps her paw when it's pointing left."
    "她指向左侧时，狮子兽人拍了拍她的爪子。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3534
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_a58e6ded:

    # s "Then left. Then...{w} Name?"
    s "然后左转。之后...{w}就找到那个名字？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3536
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_e8993390:

    # "That fetches another grin from the lion, who hands the note back to Sam."
    "这又让狮子笑了笑，之后把纸条还给Sam"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3538
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_1b98887d_1:

    # reggie "Good."
    reggie ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3547
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_57dba320:

    # s "Walk to the blue place, then left until we see the name?"
    s "走到蓝色的地方，之后左转我们就可以看到纸条上的名字了？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3549
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_f11f4e4f:

    # s "I think?"
    s "我想是吧？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3551
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_c3c3eaaa:

    # p "I think so."
    p "我也这么想的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3553
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_70b9906f:

    # "She playfully shoves you aside."
    "她顽皮地把你推倒一边。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3555
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_20d5b2fe:

    # p "Could have actually helped me there, you know."
    p "你刚刚其实可以帮帮我的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3559
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_af749c41:

    # p "I hope we can find it."
    p "我希望我们可以找到。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3561
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_afdf9630:

    # "She smiles, her mood completely back about her and her tail waving slowly."
    "她笑了，完全恢复了以前的神气，尾巴慢慢地摇晃着。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3565
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_aa727cfe:

    # s "We will, I'm sure. Think of it's an adventure what you've got goin' for you now, so. Proper nice one, too."
    s "我们肯定能找到。想想看，你现在说不定正迈入一场新的冒险呢。还是场相当不错的冒险。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3567
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_4939fc4c:

    # s "And if we got lost, well, all them's back at the {i}souk{/i} were selling things that looked proper delicious."
    s "如果我们迷路了，嗯，{i}souk{/i}里面的美食看起来都很美味。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3569
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_694fb37a:

    # s "Get you to order me something tasty like."
    s "让你给我点一点好吃的之类的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3573
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_f18a2ddb:

    # p "I can't actually interpret, no matter what Raj says. He was just friendly, that's all."
    p "我其实都不会口译，无论Raj说什么。而他只是好心而已。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3577
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_81c80f29:

    # p "I can't interpret any more than you can, Sam. He was just friendly, that's all."
    p "我也不见得比你好，Sam。他只是比较友好而已。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3579
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_306c7a71:

    # p "It's a nice thing about Mogador, at least-the locals are friendly."
    p "至少Mogador这的居民都很友善。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3583
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_9ef580a8:

    # s "So they are. Most folks is, if you let 'em be, I find. Don't many want to cause problems."
    s "的确如此。我发现，如果你不去打扰他们，他们都很友好。没多少人想惹麻烦。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3598
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_9431b309:

    # "You had wondered if, perhaps, the directions might prove difficult to follow, but you find a building with a striking blue roof and shutters, four blocks up, on the intersection of another straight road."
    "你还以为光靠这些提示很难找到，但是在四个街区外，另一条直路的交叉口，你发现了一栋有醒目蓝色屋顶和百叶窗的建筑。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3602
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_6bc70772:

    # "Sam holds up the note: one of the words was circled on it."
    "Sam拿起纸条，其中有一些文字被画了圈。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3604
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_4d2e694c:

    # s "Think this is what we're looking for."
    s "我想这就是我们在找的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3606
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_80834f40:

    # s "If you recognize these letters any, or know what they mean..."
    s "如果你认识这些字母，或者知道它们的意思..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3608
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_67d7d499:

    # p "I don't. Can't read any of it."
    p "我不认识。一个都认不得。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3610
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_064a934e:

    # "But you could match the script enough to find it written on a shingle, above the words {i}Jardins et Brouillard{/i}."
    "但是你可以一个个地对比字母发现它被写在一块木牌上，在{i}Jardins et Brouillard{/i}（法语：花园与雾）上方。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3620
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_fef76570:

    # "A robed wolf is sitting on a bench outside, but stands when you approach. Sam gives her the note, and then lifts her coin purse, jingling it slightly."
    "一个穿着长袍的狼坐在外面的长椅上，但当你们过来时，她站了起来。Sam递给她那张纸条，再举起她的钱袋，发出清脆的叮当声。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3624
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_d8c73fd9:

    # "She nods, and beckons Samuel to follow her inside. You wait a moment, and then do the same, in time to watch the wolf dump the purse out on a table."
    "她点点头，示意Samuel随着她进去。你等了一会，也跟了进去，正好撞见了那只狼把袋子里面的东西倒到桌子上。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3640
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_4e60b93b:

    # "She purses her lips while she stares at the coins—none of them local denominations—before pulling a few aside."
    "她抿了抿嘴，盯着这些来自异域的硬币，然后把几枚推到一边。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3642
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_f406dbb2:

    # "Sam shrugs."
    "Sam耸了耸肩。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3644
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_9f646786:

    # "The wolf takes the coins, then goes to a cabinet and retrieves a heavy brass key. She points up a set of stone stairs."
    "狼收下硬币，走到一个柜子前面，取出一个沉重的铜钥匙。她向上指了指一段石台阶。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3646
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_69483175:

    # "Sam, who has not said anything, starts off, and you follow at the maned wolf's heels."
    "Sam没说一句话，顺着楼梯走了上去，而你也跟着鬃狼脚后跟上去了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3648
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_380f2fc3:

    # p "Where are we going, anyway? What is this place? Another errand for Raj?"
    p "我们这是要去哪里？这是什么地方？难道又是Raj的另一个差事？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3652
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_907bfda4:

    # "Sam tries the key, turning it and pushing the wooden door open."
    "Sam试了试钥匙，转动它并推开了木门。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3658
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_4f9c4830:

    # s "Somethin' else she suggested, back at the {i}hammam{/i}.{w} Take a look."
    s "是她在{i}hammam{/i}（阿拉伯语：土耳其浴室）时建议的别的事。{w}看看吧。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3662
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_b2b8d73f:

    # s "Errand for me, is what it is. Take a look."
    s "为我跑的差事，就是这样。看看吧。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3676
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_0403995b:

    # "There is a window, the panes open and admitting gentle afternoon light that floods a tidily—if sparsely-furnished room. A single bed, albeit wider than any you've seen before, dominates the chamber."
    "那里有一扇窗，窗玻璃敞开着，让午后温暖柔和的阳光倾泻在这整洁而略显简陋的房间。一张单人床，尽管比你以前看到的任何一张都宽，占据了房间的主要位置。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3678
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_af88836e:

    # "Besides that, there's a low table on which sits a silver pitcher and two clay cups, along with a bench and a stool to sit on."
    "除此之外，还有一张矮桌子，上面放着一个银水罐和两个陶杯，周围有一条长凳和一个凳子可以坐。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3684
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_76971952:

    # "Sam closes the door, takes a deep breath, and pounces onto the bed. The mattress yields beneath her, but not much."
    "Sam关上了门，深深地吸了一口气，之后一头栽在了床上。她的身体在床垫上微微下沉。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3689
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_a92e2879:

    # "She rolls to lay sprawled on her back, arms outstretched and muzzle agape."
    "她翻身仰面躺倒，四肢摊开，嘴巴张得大大的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3691
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_c215b3a6:

    # s "Worth it already."
    s "这已经值了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3693
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3697
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_61491bc2:

    # s "Eh?{w} Try it!"
    s "嗯？{w}试试看！"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3701
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_f8577acd:

    # "She scoots over to make room, lending emphasis to her insistence."
    "她挪了挪身子流出空间，让你赶快试试。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3705
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_b002e39f:

    # "She must have the right idea; carefully, you do as the maned wolf suggests."
    "她肯定是对的。你按照她的建议小心翼翼地爬上了床。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3709
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_ea3440e2:

    # "The sheets look fresh, and you're mindful that your clothes are anything but. Carefully, you do as the maned wolf suggests."
    "床单看起来很干净，而你注意到你的衣服截然相反。接下来你小心地听从鬃狼的建议。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3711
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_09895553:

    # "Though you, at least, first sit, and {i}then{/i} carefully recline."
    "不过你，至少，先坐下，{i}之后{/i}才小心地躺下。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3715
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_45fb8589:

    # p "{i}Oh.{/i}"
    p "{i}哦。{/i}"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3717
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_41a54e62:

    # "Perhaps, back home, you might not have considered it luxurious. But it's better than your childhood cot."
    "可能，到家乡，你不会认为这很豪华。但是这比你童年的小床好。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3719
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_a963b63b:

    # "And—once you really {i}feel{/i} it under your back—the difference to a swaying hammock on the {i}Conway{/i} is almost enough to make you sob."
    "而且，一旦你{i}感受到{/i}你背下的床垫是何等舒适，和{i}康威号{/i}上摇摇晃晃的吊床相比，这几乎足以让你哭出来。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3723
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_6ea4a5f9:

    # "Sam, grinning madly next to you, shoves you playfully."
    "Sam在你旁边疯狂地笑你，开玩笑的推你一下。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3725
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_05f85def:

    # s "See?"
    s "看到了吧？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3727
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_4c1d1127:

    # p "You're staying the night?"
    p "你要在这里过夜吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3733
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_48ce2b47:

    # s "Couldn't drag me from this with the whole damn crew workin' the capstan. The baths were nice and all, but when am I gettin' the chance for this?"
    s "就算那一船该死的水手一起用转盘拽我也休想把我拽走。浴室是很不错，但是我什么时候能有这种机会？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3735
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_9033bea0:

    # s "It be a piss-poor substitute, but a feckin' nice,{w} plush,{w} comfortable,..."
    s "这是个差劲的替代品，但是这他妈也太好，太{w}柔软，太{w}舒服了..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3739
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_0a2e3907:

    # s "Couldn't drag me from this with the whole damn crew workin' the capstan. I were thinkin' about... you know, thinkin' about the baths and all, an' that'd be nice, I reckon, sure. But when am I gettin' the chance for this?"
    s "就算一船该死的船员一同拉绞盘也别想把我从这拽走。我一直在想...呃，在想浴室什么的，那当然好，我承认。但是什么时候我有这种机会？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3741
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_c209b452:

    # s "Can still pour a bucket over my head or, if I have to, jump into the harbor."
    s "我可以往头上浇水，或者必要的时候直接跳入海港里。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3743
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_a0d8457e:

    # s "It's a poor substitute, but a feckin' nice,{w} plush,{w} comfortable,..."
    s "这是个差劲的替代品，但是这他妈也太好，太{w}柔软，太{w}舒服了..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3745
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_0c9996ea:

    # "She stretches the emphasis of each word further and further."
    "她把每个词都拉得特别长。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3749
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_e3164ba6:

    # s "...clean bed in an actual room all for my own? Can't sneak that back onto the ship."
    s "一张干净的床和一个属于我的房间？船上可没这个待遇。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3751
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_9827cb0b:

    # p "Mhm, ain't that the truth..."
    p "嗯，那可不是嘛..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3753
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_9f35f3b7:

    # p "It is {i}very{/i} comfortable."
    p "这{i}非常{/i}舒服。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3757
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_b84e080b:

    # s "So 'tis. 'Til the mornin', then, I'm living in luxury, I am. Prince -{w} sultan? They's gots sultans here, don't they?"
    s "确实是。那么到明天早上为止，我都在过奢华的生活。就像王子{w}苏丹。他们这有苏丹吧？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3759
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_d87eae33:

    # p "I think so?"
    p "应该有吧？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3761
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_27e71b3f:

    # s "Sultan O'Connor."
    s "苏丹·奥康纳。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3765
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_8ebb0435:

    # s "Bet there's not grog in that pitcher, either, eh?"
    s "我打赌那个水罐里面没有格罗格酒。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3769
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_700ae620:

    # "You sit back up and immediately regret the act. But, committed, you get to your feet anyway, and go to investigate."
    "当你坐起来的瞬间你就后悔了。但是来都来了，你起身走过去看了看那个水罐。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3771
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_763924fa:

    # "The pitcher is full of clear liquid. Water, you think. {i}Perhaps{/i}."
    "水罐里面盛满干净的液体。你想{i}可能{/i}是水。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3773
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_b73a1341:

    # p "Water? With something in it—flowers, it smells like?"
    p "水吗？但是里面有东西，闻起来像是...花？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3777
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_7b546c37:

    # s "Oh! Rose water! Know how to treat us guests—just as Rajeeyah told me they would, like."
    s "哦！是玫瑰水！他们真的很会招待我们客人，就像Rajeeyah告诉我的一样。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3781
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_13ea5523:

    # s "Pour us some, then, why don't you?"
    s "那么倒一点吧，怎么样？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3787
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_01bd50cc:

    # "Sam, too, has sat up, and takes the cup you offer. She stares out through the open window."
    "Sam也坐了起来，尝了尝你递过来的玫瑰水。她的目光投向窗外的世界。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3789
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_ffe34758:

    # "It faces west; you are near enough to the sea, and above the surrounding buildings, that while you remain standing you can just catch the deep blue of open ocean."
    "窗户朝西；你离大海足够近，而且周围的建筑都比你矮，所以当你站着时，刚好可以看到那宽阔蔚蓝的海洋。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3791
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_b12455bf:

    # s "Sit."
    s "坐下。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3793
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_a47112d7:

    # "You follow Sam's order. She is unwrapping the parcel she'd acquired at the market, tied loosely with a bit of hemp twine."
    "你听从Sam的命令。她正在解开从市场买来的那个包裹，包裹用一根麻绳松散地系这。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3795
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_c09a3442:

    # "There are several dark glass bottles, and a paper box, folded shut."
    "里面有几个黑色的玻璃瓶，一个被叠得严严实实的纸盒子。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3799
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_19220b60:

    # s "Let's see..."
    s "让我们看看..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3801
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_d929a38d:

    # "Opening the box revealed a half-dozen dun-colored, diamond-shaped blocks, which you think at first might be stones."
    "打开盒子，露出了六块暗黄色的菱形块状物，你起初以为可能是石头。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3803
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_f470fc30:

    # "Then she pulls one out, and you decide it must be some kind of baked good, glistening with whatever filled it."
    "然后她拿出一块，你以为它一定是某种烘烤过的东西，里面填充的东西让它闪闪发光。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3805
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_528d09c6:

    # p "What is that?"
    p "那是什么？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3809
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_d29d82d0:

    # s "Raj said it was... {i}balka{/i}-something—she wrote it down for me to show them stall—keepers, but you know... fat lot of good that does us fools, what can't read it."
    s "Raj说这叫...{i}巴尔卡{/i}，她写下来让我们给摊主看看，但是你也知道...这对我们这样不认得本地字的傻瓜一点用都没有。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3813
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_1ac424e2:

    # "She shrugged, samples it, and gasps."
    "她耸耸肩，尝了一口，倒吸一口气。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3818
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_2dd6d886:

    # s "Nuts? Here."
    s "坚果？给。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3820
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_15cbdf5e:

    # "You take the piece from her, and bite down carefully."
    "你从她的手里接过一块，小心地咬了一口。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3822
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_e9baf500:

    # "Crunchy dough on the top gives way to a sweet, dense filling: honey, and a hint of lemon, and..."
    "咬碎顶层酥脆的面皮下面是香甜扎实的馅料，有蜂蜜，一点点柠檬风味，和..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3824
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_9397740c:

    # p "Nuts, I think, yes... It's very good."
    p "应该是坚果，嗯...很好吃。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3826
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_28621663:

    # "Sam plucks it back from your fingers, and eats half of the remaining pastry, licking her muzzle and reaching for the cup of rose water."
    "Sam从你手中抢回点心，吃掉剩下的半块，舔了舔嘴又伸手去拿那杯玫瑰水。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3830
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_874a2870:

    # s "Almond, I'm pretty sure. There's a little almond resting on the middle of them, too—or there were, 'til I ate it."
    s "杏仁，我相当确定。中间还放了块小杏仁，但是我已经把它吃掉了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3832
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_d7d494d9:

    # s "Shame Bandile don't carry those on the ship. Nor enough honey, I imagine, either. Mm?"
    s "可惜班迪尔船上没有这些。而且蜂蜜估计也没有，你觉得呢？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3834
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_5748b910:

    # "She hands it back to you. You nibble, but—seeing her enjoyment—let her have the rest."
    "她把剩下的还给你。你小口咬着，但看到她回味无穷的样子，你还是把剩下的点心给了她。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3836
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_56d2eb21:

    # p "Raj didn't ask for that?"
    p "Raj没有要这个吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3840
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_623634b3:

    # s "You mean: am I stealin' it from her?"
    s "你是说，是不是我从她那边偷来的？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3842
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_c6ca78bd:

    # s "No, we're friends. Don't do that to friends. If there's any left, she can have some for free."
    s "不是，我们是朋友。我不会那样对朋友。如果还有剩，她可以免费得到一些。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3846
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_4a9480b2:

    # "The maned wolf looks at the open box, as if considering whether or not to help herself to a second piece."
    "鬃狼看着这个被打开的盒子，好像再考虑是否再吃一块。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3850
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_cbdb7665:

    # "Thinking better of it, she puts the pastry away, and flops back on the bed."
    "想了想还是作罢，她把点心收好，之后向后栽倒到床上。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3854
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_67e9f00b:

    # s "Could be a good port call. Yours?"
    s "这是一次不错的靠港精力。你呢？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3856
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_6a0c803d:

    # p "Well... it's my first. So it's the best I've ever had by default."
    p "嗯...这是我的第一次靠港。所以我想这就是目前我最好的一次。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3861
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_fc8901f3:

    # "Sam snickers when you point this out, and bats your shoulder until you follow her lead in reclining on the bed again."
    "当你说出这一点时，Sam在旁边窃笑，之后她拍打着你的肩膀，直到你跟着她再次躺在床上。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3863
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_2111acdf:

    # "The ceiling, like the walls, is a warm, comforting ochre, almost orange if the warmth of the sun hits it just right."
    "天花板和墙壁一样，是用温暖舒适的赭石做的，如果阳光恰到好处，颜色就几乎变成橙色。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3865
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_b719a71f:

    # p "I'm glad I was able to get off the ship. Spend time with you, too."
    p "我很高兴我能够下船。也很高兴能和你共度时光。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3867
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_15dce2d0:

    # s "Kind of invited yourself along."
    s "算是你自己跟过来的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3871
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_a9ba007a:

    # p "I suppose. I mean... I'd said I was going to help Raj."
    p "我想是吧。我意思是...我说我是过来帮Raj的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3873
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_8a953b16:

    # s "And y'did. And helped with the directions, too."
    s "而你确实帮了。并且还帮忙指路了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3877
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_16fcfc7b:

    # p "I suppose. I mean, I don't mind helping Raj."
    p "我想是吧。我是说，我不介意帮Raj。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3879
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_2a118ddf:

    # s "And you have!"
    s "而你已经帮了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3881
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_94660227:

    # p "Do you want me to take those things to her tonight, when I head back?"
    p "你想要我今晚把这些东西给她吗？在我回去的时候。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3885
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_f75d83bb:

    # s "{i}Are{/i} you headed back?"
    s "{i}你{/i}要回去吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3887
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_f7a6d6e9:

    # "You twist; Sam has turned her head, although she still has to look at you lop-sidedly, from the corner of her eye."
    "你转过身；Sam也已经转过头来，尽管还斜斜地用眼角看着你。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3891
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_22a69307:

    # p "Well... it's your room, not mine."
    p "呃...这是你的房间，不是我的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3893
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_33daddf8:

    # s "And you're my friend, same as Raj is. You could stay here."
    s "而你是我的朋友，和Raj一样。你可以带着这里。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3895
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_71ae4769:

    # "You could."
    "你可以的。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3897
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_6608b902:

    # "The ship's mates know where you are—Rajeeyah gave Sam the address, after all."
    "船上地伙计知道你在哪里，毕竟Rajeeyah给了Sam地址。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3901
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_1ad205d2:

    # "Sam rolls onto her side. You can feel her eyes on you. Waiting."
    "Sam测过身。你能感觉她的眼神在你身上。等着。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3903
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_51c15ac8:

    # p "Well... yes."
    p "嗯...好吧。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3905
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_a8c2b9b4:

    # s "You want to go back to the ship? Or stay?"
    s "你是想回到船上？还是留下？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3907
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_e22093aa:

    # "The truth is that you want—more than nearly anything—to remain exactly wherever she is."
    "但是你的心之所向是无论在哪里你都想留在她身边。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3909
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_0c3503d7:

    # "No matter what else Sam has planned. Going out and finding a bar, probably, or a bazaar to add to the collection of trinkets back on the ship."
    "不管Sam计划了什么。可能是出去找一个酒吧，或者去集市再买一些带到船上的小玩意。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3911
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_3656dbb5:

    # "Or nothing at all: sitting, the heat of the canid lanky body at your side, to watch the wheeling gulls."
    "或者什么都不做，就坐着感受鬃狼修长身体散发过来的提问，看着盘旋的海鸥。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3913
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_3b88c420:

    # p "Yes."
    p ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3917
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_10491695:

    # "You glance over. Sam is grinning. Impulsively, you turn further, to get a better look. She snickers—at your expression? Your answer?"
    "你瞥了一眼。Sam正在咧嘴笑着。你一时冲动，转过身去，想多看看她。她窃笑起来，笑你的表情，还是回答？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3919
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_e77d880f:

    # s "Weren't a 'yes' kinda question."
    s "这不是个“是或否”的问题。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3921
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_2e0d62a1:

    # "{i}Oh, so it wasn't{/i}. Something must be distracting you."
    "{i}哦，原来不是{/i}。一定有什么东西分散了你的注意力。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3926
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_f9139a03:

    # "Before you can reply, her right arm is draped over you."
    "还没来得及回答，她的右手臂已经搭在你身上。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3928
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_07371539:

    # "You become aware of its warmth, and the demanding pressure it seems to exert, at the same time you become aware that being on your side has brought you quite close together, indeed."
    "你开始感受到她的温度，和不容忽视的压力，与此同时你也注意到了侧躺的姿势确实让你们靠的非常近。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3930
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_1c0d3897:

    # s "'Stay' or 'go'?"
    s "'留'还是'走'？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3932
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_531ee7b3:

    # "Whether she {i}intended{/i} it or not, her muzzle is so near to yours that you can {i}feel{/i} her words in the warmth of the maned wolf's breath, even as she lowers the volume to a whisper."
    "不知道是否有意为之，她的嘴唇离你的那么近，你可以{i}感觉到{/i}她说话时带出来的热气，即使她压低声音说悄悄话。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3934
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_2549c1ff:

    # "You do, too, instinctively."
    "你也本能的压低声音。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3936
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_a8bf56d5:

    # p "Stay, I meant."
    p "留下。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3940
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_e88ef654:

    # "Sam grins—she had, probably, known the answer before you gave it."
    "Sam笑了，她可能在你还没有说之前就知道了答案。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3945
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_b81127fa:

    # "Her arm tightens, which has the effect of drawing the maned wolf closer still. Her brush of a tail thumps twice."
    "她的胳膊抱得更紧了，也因此鬃狼你离更近了。她刷子般的尾巴怕打了两下。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3949
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_70b7213d:

    # s "Kinda figured that, and all."
    s "差不多猜到了，就这样。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3951
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_23901c1d:

    # "Given her personality—and her exuberance, and everything you've shared—the arm clasping your back could still have been on the friendly side of intimacy."
    "鉴于她的性格，她的热情，以及你们所分享的一切，那只紧紧抱着你的手臂或许更多意味着友情。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3953
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_8e335ab4:

    # "If you were to return the gesture, you sense, a sort of line would be crossed."
    "如果你回应这个姿势，你能感觉到，你会越过某种界限。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3955
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_67460790:

    # p "Did you?"
    p "你回应了吗？"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3959
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_b97662a7:

    # "Your voice has become a soft murmur, and your arm slides around her before you know that it was meant to accent the question you've just posed."
    "你的声音变成了温柔的细语，而你的手臂在你意识到之前就滑过她的身体，搂抱住她，这仿佛是为了强调你刚刚提出的问题。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3963
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_93f8ec4b:

    # s "Well..."
    s ""

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3965
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_a127a50f:

    # "She trails off."
    "她的声音逐渐减弱。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3967
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_e3ef60e8:

    # "Thinking—or plotting. Coming to some final decision."
    "思考着，或者说盘算着。正在做出最后的决定。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3969
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_a5ae1c4d:

    # "Her eyes glint, the thoughts in them flickering like a compass in a storm, spinning before snapping to its proper course."
    "她的眼睛闪闪发光，其中的思绪像暴风雨中的罗盘一样摇曳旋转，在确定航向之前摇摆不定。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3975
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_e64d3b5c:

    # "And then losing focus, because then Sam's lips are pressed to yours."
    "之后失去了注意力，因为Sam的嘴唇已经贴向你的了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3977
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_194b9d10:

    # "And you, despite the faint huskiness in the last thing she'd said, hadn't {i}known{/i}, exactly, it was going to happen."
    "她最后那句话带着一丝沙哑，而你{i}不知道{/i}这会发生。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3979
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_39752969:

    # "And you gasp, for a heartbeat or two, before you tug her closer."
    "你倒吸了一口气，心脏砰砰跳，之后将她拉得更近。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3981
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_2d5b08e8:

    # "Her own embrace tightens; abruptly, she is pushed up next to you, the heat of her lean body tight and irresistible."
    "她自己也抱得更紧了；突然，她推了你，她修长身体散发出的热量紧紧贴着你，无法抗拒。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3983
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_5cb4fa56:

    # "One of those long legs is hooked around your own. Someone growls."
    "她的一条大长腿钩住了你的腿。之后发出了低吼声。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3985
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_c221584d:

    # "There is a hint of sweetness, and then you learn that her muzzle is hot, and soft, and tastes of honey and almond."
    "你首先感觉到了一丝甜味，之后是她温热柔软的嘴唇，带有蜂蜜和杏仁的味道。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3989
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_d3c35375:

    # "A sharper, harder touch seizes your attention, leaving a burning trail between your shoulder blades."
    "一个更尖锐，更坚硬的触感吸引了你的注意，在你的肩胛骨之间留下灼烧的印记。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3991
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_4ee34473:

    # "No: five trails, in the shape of her splayed fingers."
    "不是五条印记，而是她展开手指的形状。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3996
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_ce204d28:

    # "This time, at least, you {i}know{/i} the growl is yours. You draw back, panting raggedly. Sam is still grinning."
    "这一次，至少你{i}知道{/i}这声低吼来自你自己。你抽身后退，喘着粗气。Sam还在咧嘴笑着。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:3998
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_86eeaea1:

    # s "See, now..."
    s "瞧，现在..."

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:4000
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_7e10c768:

    # "That preface is the last thing you hear before the grin disappears from view, when she steals another deep kiss."
    "这预告是你听见的最后一句话，之后她笑容从你眼前消失，随后又偷走你又一个深吻。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:4002
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_7e94aa54:

    # "She is, at least, out of breath herself."
    "至少，她自己也去喘吁吁了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:4006
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_66f36753:

    # s "If I'd thought you were like to go back to the ship, I would've asked for a smaller bed."
    s "如果我认为你会回到船上去，我就会要一张更小的床了。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:4008
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_81f9bf22:

    # p "So, we-"
    p "所以，我们-"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:4010
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_08e931e8:

    # "She cuts you off."
    "她打断你。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:4012
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_b83edb8f:

    # s "Will put this one to proper use, yes."
    s "不能白费了这么好的床。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:4018
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_aecf59dd:

    # "The maned wolf extricates herself and stands, tugging off her shirt. White, warm afternoon light frames her: perked ears, her shaggy fur crisply picked out by the silhouette."
    "鬃狼抽身站起来，脱掉了衬衫。午后白色温暖的阳光打在她身上，勾勒出她的轮廓。竖起的耳朵蓬松的毛发显得格外耀眼。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:4023
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_ec5cd812:

    # "When she turns, you can see the hint of her breasts—subtle enough, anyhow, that you suppose you might never have noticed, even if she was topless, if you'd not-"
    "当她转过身来，你能隐约看到她的胸部，朦朦胧胧的，你猜即使她没穿上衣，你可能也不会注意到，如果你没有-"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:4027
translate chinese day15_sam_hotel_af456643:

    # s "You know how this works, right? Those have to come off, too."
    s "你知道接下来会发生什么，对吧？你也要脱掉。"

# game/script morocco samuel.rpy:4031
